Package: epiforge
Title: Automatic Epidemiological Report Generator
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Luchesio", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "your@email.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = ""))
Description: 
    Automatically generates epidemiological surveillance reports (weekly, monthly)
    from routine health data in CSV or Excel format. Supports multiple geographic
    levels (district, region, national) and produces outputs in Word (.docx) and
    PDF formats. Designed for public health practitioners in low- and middle-income
    countries, with compatibility with DHIS2 data exports.
